# =============================================================================
# Samvada Platform — ABS & Worker Environment Configuration
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REAL EMAIL DELIVERY (e.g. Gmail, SendGrid, AWS SES, Resend)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If using Gmail:
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification in your Google Account.
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Enter your Gmail and App Password below (remove spaces from the password):

SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password
SMTP_FROM=your-email@gmail.com

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LOCAL MAILPIT (Default for local development - no credentials needed)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# To use the local dev Mailpit web inbox (http://localhost:8025), keep these:
# SMTP_HOST=localhost
# SMTP_PORT=1025
# SMTP_USER=
# SMTP_PASSWORD=
# SMTP_FROM=no-reply@samvada.ai
